{"unit_id": "tag:01MU:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。令<MATH_0002>。固定一个整数（integer）<MATH_0003>。<MATH_0004>的下列开子集（open subsets）相等：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 最大的开子集（open subset）<MATH_0005>，使得每个<MATH_0006>都可逆（invertible），且所有乘法映射（maps）\n<MATH_0007>\n（见<REF_0001>）都是同构（isomorphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 开子集（open subsets）<MATH_0008>的并，其中<MATH_0009>是齐次（homogeneous）的，且<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n此外，所有映射（maps）\n<MATH_0011>\n（见<REF_0002>）都是同构（isomorphisms）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "引理所设的环。"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "引理中固定的参数所属的数类。"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "引理比较的两个子集。"}, {"source_term": "open subset", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "满足所列条件的最大子集。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "最大开子集上每个所列对象须满足的条件。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第一个列表条目中的乘法映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "第一个列表条目中所有乘法映射须满足的条件。"}, {"source_term": "open subsets", "target_term": "开子集", "context": "第二个列表条目中取并的子集。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次", "context": "第二个列表条目对所选元素的要求。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "引理末句所列的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "引理末句断言所有所列映射具有的